# Region: China (default)
# Authority: Alibaba Cloud public NTP service, official ECS documentation.
# Public service is IPv4-only. Do not add sources from another region.
# Venue Wi-Fi measured 0.37-0.41 s RTT; 0.50 s admits those samples while
# retaining two-source agreement and the separate 10 ms offset qualification.
server ntp1.aliyun.com iburst minpoll 6 maxpoll 9 maxdelay 0.50
server ntp2.aliyun.com iburst minpoll 6 maxpoll 9 maxdelay 0.50
server ntp3.aliyun.com iburst minpoll 6 maxpoll 9 maxdelay 0.50
